Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:20:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] crypto/x509: distrust a handful of intermediates

Backport the Go 1.27 fix for CVE-2026-111943 to Go 1.25.

Filter a set of intermediates from chains returned by calls to Verify.
These chains are identified via SHA-256 SPKI hashes.

In Go 1.25, filter candidate chains before policy and extended key usage
validation so that ExtKeyUsageAny cannot bypass the distrust list.
Preserve existing validation errors for the remaining chains.

Add regression coverage for all chain positions, the Windows system
verifier, ExtKeyUsageAny, and alternate trusted chains.

For golang/go#82345

(cherry picked from commit 90617fb7ceb59cf08bee7826bb51b8c8fb8c11de)
